        ["Method: measured MV = Athlon Rangecraft; sim MV = GRT Get_TabResults for the charge set in GRT."] = "Metodo: MV misurata = Athlon Rangecraft; MV sim = Get_TabResults di GRT per la carica impostata in GRT.",
